# Credentials. Never commit these. env.example is the template and is tracked.
#
# The root .gitignore already covers this, and these rules are deliberately
# redundant: a samples folder tends to get lifted out of its repository, and the
# page fetches .env over HTTP, so the protection should travel with the folder
# rather than depend on a file one level up.
.env

# File-safety backups.
backup/

# macOS
.DS_Store
